        },
        {
          "text": "Omekwa Ichon pö Makatin cho puryö Mumar ompö osis mut nko odeny, lenyini komwowokwa. Oghekwa lenyoni ompö asis nyo kïlate nyo pö arawa Apip, ompöwölo kyapkanekwa arawanoni koro Misri. Möminye chi nyo ngwïnöy tawunyan nko mori kwïle.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.23.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
